# The caller's storage (`init`'s safety contract), once per process.
Shared::begin	raw pointer from C caller	none (assumption)
# An FFI call that may re-enter the allocator: the nested entries leave
# the token as they found it (the slot premise). Kani runs the body with
# glibc's pthread_setspecific replaced by a recording stand-in; what
# glibc's function does is C10, which leaves outside it a process in which
# challoc's key is 32 or above and the thread has no block for it, the
# case where glibc's calloc re-enters the allocator, so within C10 no
# nested entry runs and the body leaves the token untouched. Under C10
# glibc returns EINVAL for any key that is not live, so the harness runs
# any key and the `# Safety` clause is not what makes the call defined.
pthread_setspecific	FFI/syscall	Kani	discharged on premises (Kani: heap::shared::kani_setspecific::setspecific_passes_key_and_value; premises: C10 (glibc's pthread_setspecific records the value under the key without reading it, or returns an error number, without calling into challoc, outside a process whose challoc key is 32 or above with no block for it on the thread))	contract 2714888459, body 1699412956
# Empty-template register hint: verus/emptyasm/run.sh checks the block adds
# no instruction to the shipped code (a verus/emptyasm/blocks.txt row);
# Kani checks the load, on a copy whose lines seams.sh --check requires
# to equal the body's but for the rows verus/kani/pins.txt marks `-only`.
ClassLine::guard_word	inline asm	Islaris/Isla	trusted (partly checked, Kani: heap::shared::kani_guard_word::guard_word_is_the_three_fields, const assert: `ClassLine::guard_word`'s word in src/heap/shared.rs, and emptyasm: guard_word in src/heap/shared.rs; not checked: the body itself, since the harness runs a copy of its load without the asm! block (Kani has no model of inline assembly), whose lines `sh verus/seams.sh --check` requires to equal the body's but for the rows verus/kani/pins.txt marks `-only`, today the opening brace and the asm! block, with comment and blank lines not compared)	contract 33478923, body 434743552
